@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Сервер жив?
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Регистрация
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+7 999 123-45-62",
  "password": "test123456!",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Иванов",
  "middleName": "Иванович",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01"
}

### 3. Вход
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "88005553535",
  "password": "admin123!"
}

